	(text "K1's NC contacts (pins 3 and 10) feed bus pin 13 (XFER, cut from GND on all four boards)\nthrough F2 (125 mA) and R12 (18 ohm) while K1 is released: ~12 V, 11-13 mA to K_XFER.\nF2 opens within milliseconds if pin 13 is ever left on GND. It does NOT protect 3V3D,\nI_SENSE or TUNE: continuity-check pins 13-11, 13-14 and 13-15 on all four headers before\nthe first power-up with XFER live. Never fit a Rev A/B board (pin 13 on GND) in this stack.\nJ2 takes the 0.3 m link to the front end's J3, not the head cable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -4140.454 2201.136 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
