	(text "D5 blocks the post-clamp reverse current; C7 + R10 make the swing through zero\nfast and damp it (C7 1 nF for up to 15 m of Belden-8760-class head cable; longer or\nhigher-capacitance cable must be re-simulated); R11 bleeds DRAIN to +12V between\nshots; D4 clamps any open in the COIL_P feed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -4140.454 2182.348 0)
