	(text "Patrick Muyenzi's power board (isolated +/-5 V) replaces the rev C power board. This board\ntakes its outline: 80 x 60 mm, M3 holes 4 mm in from each edge. Circuit = rev D plus J3,\nthe 12 V input (Phoenix MKDS 1,5/2-5,08, beside Patrick's J1). The bus moved to x 62 mm;\npins 1/3 carry 12 V up to the acquisition board, pin 19 (N5_SHDN) is spare.\nPart and Digi-Key numbers: polarization_switch_rev_E_BOM.xlsx."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at -4140.454 2246.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c56b20c1-1ce6-5078-ab4f-fdb14a7f55db")
	)
	(text "XFER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 48.26 0)
		(effects
