	(text "Rev C coil, COMPUTED, PROVISIONAL: 690 t of 22 AWG as two counter-wound 345 t halves in\nseries (2.75 in acrylic tubes, water in both): ~11.3 mH, 8.3 ohm (9.6 hot), C_p 0.14-0.59 nF,\n~4.0 mT/A. From 12 V: ~1.3 A cold / 1.1 A hot (1.19 / 1.03 A through 15 m of head cable)."
